      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better variable names and assertion messages.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: renamed `script1/2/3/4` to `tagLowerCase/tagUpperCase/tagLowerCaseFromTagSet/tagUpperCaseFromTagSet` for clarity, added descriptive assertion messages explaining what each assertion verifies, and added brief comments above each test method to state the intent."
